{"product_id":"you-are-a-badass","title":"You Are a Badass: How to Stop Doubting Your Greatness and Start Living an Awesome Life","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn this refreshingly entertaining how-to guide, #1 \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eNew York Times\u003c\/i\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Bestselling Author and world-traveling success coach, Jen Sincero, serves up 27 bite-sized chapters full of hilariously inspiring stories, sage advice, easy exercises, and the occasional swear word. If you're ready to make some serious changes around here, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eYou Are a Badass\u003c\/i\u003e\u003cspan\u003e will help you: Identify and change the self-sabotaging beliefs and behaviors that stop you from getting what you want, blast past your fears so you can take big exciting risks, figure out how to make some damn money already, learn to love yourself and others, set big goals and reach them - it will basically show you how to create a life you totally love, and how to create it \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003enow\u003c\/i\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBy the end of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eYou Are a Badass\u003c\/i\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, you'll understand why you are how you are, how to love what you can't change, how to change what you don't love, and how to use The Force to kick some serious ass.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Jen Waite\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780735216464\u003cbr\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePages: 272\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: 149 x 216\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44270731526297,"sku":"17RB-4-9780735216464","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/youre.jpg?v=1714667888","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/you-are-a-badass","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book"